TwinCity
========

TwinCity is a modified version of Micropolis, the GPL release of the original SimCity
source code. It is a translation of the original C (micropolis-activity, pinned as the
oracle/upstream submodule) into Swift. Per the additional terms below, this is a MODIFIED
version and is not identified as the original program. TwinCity is not affiliated with
or endorsed by Electronic Arts Inc. or Micropolis GmbH, and does not use the SimCity or
Micropolis names for the port.

